    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "text" : "Cancel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "text" : "Oh, are you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "text" : "interested in Luoyang?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "text" : "It's a nice place to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "text" : "visit for travelers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "text" : "Luoyang has a long history"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "text" : "with stories of ancient magic and warriors. It's also rumored that many evil beasts roam the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "text" : "Luoyang area."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "text" : "You can find cure-all medicines, mysterious occurrences, and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "text" : "martial artists all in one place!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "text" : "I used to train in the martial arts every morning back when I was in Luoyang. I might not look like it, but I'm pretty strong!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "text" : "If you want to visit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "text" : "Luoyang, feel free to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "text" : "tell me. Just give me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "text" : "some Zeny and we'll go~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "text" : "I'll guide you to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "text" : "Luoyang right away."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "text" : "For my service, I am"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "text" : "accepting 10,000 Zeny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "text" : "So, are you ready?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "text" : "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "text" : "Okay~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "text" : "Ready!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "text" : "Have fun!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "text" : "You don't seem"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "text" : "to have 10,000 Zeny..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "text" : "Go get some money first!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "text" : "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "text" : "It's so disappointing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "text" : "to hear you say that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "text" : "Well, have a good day!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "text" : "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "text" : "Have a good day!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
