      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "I hope to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "see you again!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Bye bye!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "If you like this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "area, why don't you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "stay and enjoy the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "the food and the sights!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "And by sights..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "I mean girls!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "Tee hee~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "[Girl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "And the boys here"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "text" : "aren't bad looking~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "[Zhi Ching Li]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "All the members of the Maiden Palace, including myself and our master, are all female."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "[Zhi Ching Li]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "Recently we've had a hard time recruiting new members, so I came here to check if there's any woman who wishes to join us."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "[Zhi Ching Li]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "[Zhi Ching Li]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "......"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "[Zhi Ching Li]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "Please leave me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Muscular Woman",
      "text" : "alone, I'm busy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "[Akiira]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "I am practicing my 'Claw of Dragon.' I not only need to use the power of my fists, I must also condition myself spiritually."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "[Akiira]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "Every martial art requires"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "spiritual training since the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "mind controls the body."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "If you've trained yourself spiritually, you can easily"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "use any part of the body!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "[Akiira]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "If you are considering"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "studying the martial arts, you should first attain knowledge before jumping into the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "physical training."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "[Akiira]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "Learn about the martial arts"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Powerful-looking guy",
      "text" : "and meditate on life's truths. First, you must find peace of mind before you can hope to master the mind and body."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "[Zhiang Xiau Ji]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "Finally..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "I have mastered"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "the 'Claw of Dragon!'"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "[Zhiang Xiau Ji]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "Although there are eight basic steps, I had to learn the history of this art, and meditate, focusing on my spiritual improvement,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "for three years."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "[Zhiang Xiau Ji]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "After that, my master finally started to give me the physical training so I could use the eight steps of the Claw of Dragon. I've devoted myself to this art for thirty years."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "[Zhiang Xiau Ji]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "I'm very proud that I've"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "mastered this art ten years earlier than I expected. Now, I need to study this form and improve it by correcting its weak points and enhancing its strengths."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "[Zhiang Xiau Ji]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "I guess that would take me about ten years. But I'm not disheartened by that at all."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "[Zhiang Xiau Ji]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Fist master",
      "text" : "When you're learning a martial art, you can't rush yourself and learn everything in a short period of time. It's impossible! Plus, that isn't the essence of art..."
    },
